        'm: Gم|Millions of tonnes of plastic ______ into the sea every year.|go|goes|going',
        'm: Gم|Plastic bags ______ hundreds of years to break down.|take|takes|taking',
        'm: Gن|We should use ______ plastic.|less|fewer|least',
